		{
			"ecmsId": 27827,
			"tbxId": "H1126",
			"provider": "TBX",
			"name": "Sandals Halcyon Beach St. Lucia",
			"type": "hotel",
			"atop": "",
			"hotelDescription": "This Luxury Included&#xae; resort, exclusive to adults, is located on a sandy beach with wonderful cottage-style gardens surrounding the charming low rise accommodation room blocks that lend a decidedly English feel.",
			"tailorMadeHotelDescription": "",
			"address": "Castries, St. Lucia",
			"virginsViewExtraShort": "",
			"virginView": "This Luxury Included&#xae; resort, exclusive to adults, is located on a sandy beach with wonderful cottage-style gardens surrounding the charming low rise accommodation blocks that lend a decidedly English feel. The lush setting and secluded ambiance make Sandals Halcyon Beach a favourite with many guests who return year after year, treating the resort as a second home. Stay in a Beachfront Romeo &amp; Juliet Walkout Butler Room, just steps from the sandy beach and enjoy the services of a Personal Butler. For a unique dining experience visit Kelly&apos;s Dockside restaurant and savour fresh seafood while enjoying the amazing views from a pier that dramatically extends over the ocean.",
			"whereIsIt": "On Choc Bay, just outside the capital city of Castries. Transfer time from airport: 1 hour 15 minutes.",
			"vRating": "None",
			"accommodationDetails": "<p>169 rooms. All have a balcony/patio and garden views, air-conditioning, ceiling fan, satellite TV, complimentary&#xa0;WiFi access, iPod docking station, coffee/tea maker, safe, iron and board, hairdryer and 1 king-size bed. Crystal Lagoon Poolside Luxury Rooms are located on the second floors, and feature a smart TV and 1 king-size bed.</p>",
			"accommodationUpgrades": "<p>Crystal Lagoon Walkout Swim-Up Club Level Rooms are recently renovated, and located on the ground floor, with direct pool access from the patio and 1 king-size bed.</p><p>Grand Luxe Club Level Room with Balcony Tranquility Soaking Tub are located on the 1st floor. The bedroom is equipped with 1 king-size bed and a large, flat-screen smart TV.</p><p>Grand Luxe Club Level Walkout Room with Patio Tranquility Soaking Tub are newly renovated rooms, found on the ground floor. These rooms boast a private patio with soaking tub for two and privacy curtains.</p><p>Oceanview Club Level Room with Balcony Tranquility Soaking Tub are newly renovated rooms, framed by ocean views within the second levels. The private balcony boasts views of the sea and a private soaking tub for two with privacy curtains.</p><p>Honeymoon Butler Room with Private Pool Sanctuary are newly built suites located on the garden level. With spa-like features including a glass-enclosed walk-in shower, and the private plunge pool in the garden.</p><p>Beachfront Club Level Walkout Room with Patio Tranquility Soaking Tub are newly renovated beachfront rooms located on the ground floor. These rooms boast sea views from from the private patio, which includes a soaking tub for two with privacy curtains.</p><p>Beachfront Honeymoon Walkout Club Level Rooms with Patio Tranquility Soaking Tub are newly renovted rooms, offering views of the ocean and gardens. The bathroom has spa-like features including a luxurious soaking tub and a glass-enclosed shower. The private patio is complete with a soaking tub for two with privacy curtains.</p><p>Beachfront Honeymoon Butler Room with Private Pool Sanctuary are newly built beachfront suites, with private plunge pool in the garden.</p><p>Beachfront Crystal Lagoon Swim-up Butler Room with Patio Tranquility Soaking Tub provide direct swim-up access from your private patio and offer views of the&#xa0;views of the Caribbean Sea. The private patio boasts a soaking tub for two with privacy curtains, and inside a plush king-size bed and a spa-style bathroom complete with a luxurious soaking tub and an overside walk-in shower.<br /></p><p><strong>Club Sandals Service:</strong></p><ul><li>Dedicated Club Sandals Lounge accessible 24-hours with Club Sandals concierge available 8:00am-10:00pm daily to assist with excursions, restaurant reservations, spa bookings and anything else you may need</li><li>Preferred Club Sandals Lounge check-in with chilled towel and Champagne upon arrival</li><li>Weekly hosted activities such a cocktail parties, martini evenings, wine tasting and snorkelling</li><li>In-room stocked mini-bar with a selection of spirits, beer and wine as well as soft drinks, juices and water</li></ul><p><strong>Sandals Butler Service:</strong></p><p>Providing you with uncompromising attention of a personal butler trained to the highest standards by the elite Guild of Professional English Butlers. Beginning with lemongrass-scented hand towels and welcome cocktails and culinary treats upon arrival, a private resort orientation and a luggage unpacking service you will then be supplied with a personal mobile phone to reach your Butler when needed. Your wish is their command! In addition, you will also have 24-hour room service and access to all the Club Sandals amenities and weekly activities.</p>",
			"facilities": "",
			"roomFacilities": null,
			"eatsDrinks": "5-Star Global Gourmet&#x2122; at Sandals Resorts brings new sights, sounds and tastes to all guests at each meal &#x2014; of course, all included! Bayside (International buffet for breakfast and lunch and &#xe0; la carte French cuisine for dinner), Kelly&apos;s Dockside (&#xe0; la carte; grilled specialities), Mario&apos;s (Italian) Kimonos (entertaining Teppanyaki), Soy (Sushi Bar) and The Beach Bistro (grill open from 10:30am-6:00pm plus open for late night snacks). 21 additional dining options at Sandals Grande St. Lucian Spa &amp; Beach Resort and Sandals Regency La Toc Golf Resort &amp; Spa (transfers included). 7 bars.",
			"funGames": "2 swimming pools, 1 scuba pool, 3 whirlpools. Red Lane&#xae; fitness centre, shuffleboard, table tennis, floodlit tennis, volleyball and giant chess. Scuba-diving* (free for certified divers, fee applies to others), windsurfing, water-skiing, kayaks, wakeboarding, kneeboarding and tubing. Red Lane&#xae; Spa at nearby Sandals Resorts (treatments*). Complimentary green fees and transfers to Sandals Golf Club at Sandals Regency La Toc Golf Resort &amp; Spa (caddies mandatory*).",
			"handyStuff": "Exchange privileges with Sandals Grande St. Lucian Spa &amp; Beach Resort and Sandals Regency La Toc Golf Resort &amp; Spa in St. Lucia (transfers included). Laundry/dry-cleaning service*. Complimentary WiFi access in all room categories and public areas. Resort Shop* and SnapShots* photo shop.",
			"additionalInfo": "<p>*Denotes local charge.</p><p><strong>Please note:</strong> two people in love over 18 years only.</p><p><strong>Dress code:</strong> evening dress code for gentlemen states that smart trousers or jeans, long or short sleeve dress shirts (with or without collar) and dress shoes or sandals must be worn. Shorts, t-shirts, sleeveless shirts, trainers, flip-flops, hats and caps are not permitted in the evening.</p>",
			"gettingAround": "",
			"entertainment": "Evening entertainment with live shows, beach parties, theme nights, karaoke and cocktail parties.",
			"features": "",
			"minimumStay": "<p>2 nights.</p>",
